<div class="_none col-12 col-md-9 mt-7 block block-layout-builder block-field-blocknodedatasetfield-ds-file-naming-convention">
  
            <h2 class="mb-3">File Naming Convention</h2>
        
            <div class="content">
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-ds-file-naming-convention field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="tex2jax_process">MOD13A3.A2025152.h01v11.061.2025195144044.hdf<br><br>The file name begins with the Product Short Name (MOD13A3) followed by the Julian Date of Acquisition formatted as AYYYYDDD (A2025152), the Tile Identifier which is horizontal tile and vertical tile provided as hXXvYY (h01v11), the Version of the data collection (061), the Julian Date and Time of Production designated as YYYYDDDHHMMSS (2025195144044), and the Data Format (hdf).</div></div>
      
      </div>
      </div>



